      "content": "Yeah, about that \"minimal disruption\" part—the engineers are actually pretty worried. Since we're dropping to 4-bit, we're likely going to lose a huge amount of the subtle dialectal nuances and the cultural context layers you've been building. It's basically going to strip the high-fidelity data that makes your translations accurate. It's a necessary cut to keep the servers running, though.",
